{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Draw &amp; Play!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draw. Play. Laugh. Retry.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draw &amp; Play</i> is a creative platformer where you build your own level by drawing it yourself!<br>Sketch platforms, create obstacles, add doodle enemies\u2026 then jump in instantly to test your ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complicated menus here \u2014 it\u2019s fast, fun, intuitive.<br>A living, interactive sketchbook where everything you draw comes to life.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u270f\ufe0f <strong>Create your level\u2026 by drawing it</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw platforms, walls, trampolines, danger zones, and more.<br>Customize shapes, sizes, and styles using your doodle brush.<br>Add preset elements like spikes, crates, objects and enemies to increase the challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything you draw becomes playable.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Instantly test your ideas</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One click \u2192 and your doodle character jumps into your creation.<br>No waiting, no loading screens \u2014 you go from idea to gameplay in a second.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7e <strong>Funny doodle enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Static enemies<br>Moving enemies<br>Chasers that follow the player<br>Cartoon obstacles<br>Hand-drawn traps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level can be as cute\u2026 or as cruel as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Share and explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thanks to the Steam Workshop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish your levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play levels made by other players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge the community</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover creative (and chaotic) ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rate, comment, and create fun contests with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draw &amp; Play</i> is a game that grows thanks to its players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f Ultra-intuitive doodle editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Instant creation \u2192 gameplay switch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e A variety of enemies &amp; traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Steam Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd23 Unique sketchbook art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Regular updates with new doodles and obstacles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-generated content notice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses some AI-generated visual elements (UI icons and some backgrounds). All gameplay systems, code and game design are fully handcrafted.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047980?t=1768916600","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4047980?t=1768916600","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047980/ccda3fa546c380ea4165bd997710119073dca700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768916600","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047980/ccda3fa546c380ea4165bd997710119073dca700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768916600","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud8