s with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Draw &amp; Play</i> is a game that grows thanks to its players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f Ultra-intuitive doodle editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Instant creation \u2192 gameplay switch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e A variety of enemies &amp; traps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d Steam Workshop support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd23 Unique sketchbook art style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udce6 Regular updates with new doodles and obstacles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI-generated content notice:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game uses some AI-generated visual elements (UI icons and some backgrounds). All gameplay systems, code and game design are fully handcrafted.</p>","developers":["Rifa\u00ef Games Studio"],"ext_user_account_notice":"Rifai ","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4047980/d7522d51e4fa707b0504244cd5e04e4174143eac/header.jpg?t=1768916600","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047980/1332161765/a4e9a254a1665defc0756b8cd6710802437365ac/1765449506/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765451010","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047980/1332161765/a4e9a254a1665defc0756b8cd6710802437365ac/1765449506/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765451010","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4047980/1332161765/a4e9a254a1665defc0756b8cd6710802437365ac/1765449506/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765451010","id":257214814,"name":"Trailer - Draw & Play !","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst